>I just started playing nethack recently, and I got some questions.
> 
>1) What good is a scroll of fire?

None, really.  It mainly exists to make you careful about reading scrolls.

>2) I #dip like crazy and never get excaliber, all I get is nymphs that steal
>        my stuff. what am I doing wrong.

Well, if you're dipping a long sword, you're not doing anything wrong. 
Just bad luck.

>3) I went to a shop that had the follwing message "Closed for Inventory"
>        How do I get the shop to open?

You have to unlock the door.  Try either a skeleton key, a credit card
or a lock pick.  DON'T destroy the door.  It will anger the shopkeeper,
which is a bad idea.

